      "type": "FUNCTION",
      "name": "final",
      "brief": "Flush, close and disable all log files.\nCall it once on the application shutdown, e.g. from the `final` of your bootstrap script.\nFurther log messages will not reopen the files until `set_file` / `set_file_nearby` is called again",
      "description": "Flush, close and disable all log files.\nCall it once on the application shutdown, e.g. from the `final` of your bootstrap script.\nFurther log messages will not reopen the files until `set_file` / `set_file_nearby` is called again",
